      "description": "Compact text navigation with wrapping phone layout.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#library\">Library</a><a href=\"#manage\">Manage videos</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:'HomeReel Inter',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;font-size:14px;} .ds-nav a{color:#edf2f3;text-decoration:none;} .ds-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;} .ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #a5dfcd;outline-offset:4px;} @media(max-width:600px){.ds-nav{gap:16px;font-size:12px;}}"
